]

“Yo pana bhikkhu methunaṃ dhammaṃ patiseveyya, pārājiko hoti asaṃvāso
”ti.

Evañcidaṃ bhagavatā bhikkhūnaṃ sikkhāpadaṃ paññattaṃ hoti.

