  titthiyasāvakabhāvaṃ patthayamāno assamaṇabhāvaṃ patthayamāno
  asakyaputtiyabhāvaṃ patthayamāno: ‘Yannūnāhaṃ buddhaṃ paccakkheyyan
  'ti vadati viññāpeti, evampi bhikkhave dubbalyāvīkammañceva hoti
  sikkhā ca apaccakkhātā.

