  dukkaṭassa; tena phuṭṭhassa dukkhā vedanā uppajjati, āpatti
  thullaccayassa; marati, āpatti pārājikassa. Manāpikaṃ phoṭṭhabbaṃ
  upasaṃharati, sukhasamphassaṃ mudusamphassaṃ “Iminā phuṭṭho alābhakena
  sussitvā marissatī ”ti, āpatti dukkaṭassa; tena phuṭṭho alābhakena
  sussati, āpatti thullaccayassa; marati, āpatti pārājikassa.
