  vaṇṇavā pīṇindriyo pasannamukhavaṇṇo vippasannachavivaṇṇo. Kinnu kho
  tvaṃ āvuso seyyasaka bhesajjaṃ karosī ”ti? “Na kho ahaṃ āvuso
  bhesajjaṃ karomi. Api cāhaṃ yāvadatthaṃ bhuñjāmi, yāvadatthaṃ supāmi,
  yāvadatthaṃ nahāyāmi, yāvadatthaṃ bhuñjitvā yāvadatthaṃ supitvā
  yāvadatthaṃ nahāyitvā, yadā me anabhirati uppajjati, rāgo cittaṃ
  anuddhaṃseti, tadā hatthena uppakkamitvā asuciṃ mocemī ”ti.
]

