  bhikkhave kaṇiṭṭho isi maṇikaṇṭhaṃ nāgarājānaṃ gaṅgaṃ nadiṃ
  uttarantaṃ. Disvāna maṇikaṇṭhaṃ nāgarājānaṃ etadavoca: “Maṇiṃ me bho
