  aparikkamanaṃ, āpatti dvinnaṃ dukkaṭānaṃ. Bhikkhu vihāraṃ karoti
  desitavatthukaṃ sārambhaṃ saparikkamanaṃ, āpatti dukkaṭassa. Bhikkhu
  vihāraṃ karoti desitavatthukaṃ anārambhaṃ aparikkamanaṃ, āpatti
