  kalandakanivāpe. Tena kho pana samayena mettiyabhummajakā bhikkhū
  gijjhakūṭā pabbatā orohantā addasaṃsu chagalakaṃ 1 ajikāya
  vippaṭipajjantaṃ, disvāna evamāhaṃsu: “Handa mayaṃ āvuso imaṃ
  chagalakaṃ dabbaṃ mallaputtaṃ nāma karoma, imaṃ ajikaṃ mettiyaṃ nāma
  bhikkhuniṃ karoma. Evaṃ mayaṃ voharissāma: ‘Pubbe mayaṃ āvuso dabbaṃ
  mallaputtaṃ sutena avocumha, idāni pana amhehi sāmaṃ diṭṭho mettiyāya
  bhikkhuniyā vippaṭipajjanto '”ti. Te taṃ chagalakaṃ dabbaṃ mallaputtaṃ
  nāma akaṃsu, taṃ ajikaṃ mettiyaṃ nāma bhikkhuniṃ akaṃsu.
]

Te bhikkhūnaṃ ārocesuṃ: “Pubbe mayaṃ āvuso dabbaṃ mallaputtaṃ sutena
avocumha idāni pana amhehi sāmaṃ diṭṭho mettiyāya bhikkhuniyā
vippaṭipajjanto ”ti. Bhikkhū evamāhaṃsu: “Mā āvuso evaṃ avacuttha,
nāyasmā dabbo mallaputto evaṃ karissatī ”ti.

