  dubbhāsite saṅghādisesadiṭṭhi hoti ―pe― thullaccayadiṭṭhi hoti ―pe―
  pācittiyadiṭṭhi hoti ―pe― pāṭidesanīyadiṭṭhi hoti ―pe― dukkaṭadiṭṭhi
