  santhataṃ kārāpenti, te yācanabahulā viññattibahulā viharanti:
  “Eḷakalomāni detha eḷakalomehi attho ”ti. Manussā ujjhāyanti khīyanti
  vipācenti: “Kathaṃ hi nāma samaṇā sakyaputtiyā anuvassaṃ santhataṃ
  kārāpessanti, yācanabahulā viññattibahulā viharissanti: ‘Eḷakalomāni
  detha eḷakalomehi attho 'ti? Amhākaṃ pana sakiṃ katāni santhatāni
  pañcapi chapi vassāni honti, yesaṃ no dārakā ūhadantipi 1 ummihantipi
  undurehipi2 khajjanti. Ime pana samaṇā sakyaputtiyā anuvassaṃ
  santhataṃ kārāpenti, yācanabahulā viññattibahulā viharanti:
  ‘Eḷakalomāni detha eḷakalomehi attho '”ti.

+ Assosuṃ kho bhikkhū tesaṃ manussānaṃ ujjhāyantānaṃ khīyantānaṃ
  vipācentānaṃ. Ye te bhikkhū appicchā te ujjhāyanti khīyanti vipācenti:
  “Kathaṃ hi nāma bhikkhū anuvassaṃ santhataṃ kārāpessanti, yācanabahulā
  viññattibahulā viharissanti: ‘Eḷakalomāni detha eḷakalomehi attho
  '”ti? Atha kho te bhikkhū bhagavato etamatthaṃ ārocesuṃ. “Saccaṃ kira
  bhikkhave bhikkhū anuvassaṃ santhataṃ kārāpenti, yācanabahulā
  viññattibahulā viharanti: ‘Eḷakalomāni detha eḷakalomehi attho '”ti?
  “Saccaṃ bhagavā ”ti. Vigarahi buddho bhagavā: “Kathaṃ hi nāma te
  bhikkhave moghapurisā anuvassaṃ santhataṃ kārāpessanti, yācanabahulā
  viññattibahulā viharissanti: ‘Eḷakalomāni detha eḷakalomehi attho
  '”ti? Netaṃ bhikkhave appasannānaṃ vā pasādāya ―pe― Evañca pana
  bhikkhave imaṃ sikkhāpadaṃ uddiseyyātha:
]

“Navaṃ pana bhikkhunā santhataṃ kārāpetvā chabbassāni dhāretabbaṃ. Orena
ce channaṃ vassānaṃ taṃ santhataṃ vissajjetvā vā avissajjetvā vā aññaṃ
navaṃ santhataṃ kārāpeyya, nissaggiyaṃ pācittiyan ”ti.

Evañcidaṃ bhagavatā bhikkhūnaṃ sikkhāpadaṃ paññattaṃ hoti.
