mayampi āyasmantānaṃ kiñcimattaṃ anupadajjeyyāmā 'ti, evañca so bhikkhu
vatvā kiñcimattaṃ anupadajjeyya antamaso piṇḍapātamattampi, nissaggiyaṃ
