  pavāsaṃ gacchanto bhikkhūnaṃ santike dūtaṃ pāhesi: “Āgacchantu
  bhadantā, vassāvāsikaṃ dassāmī ”ti. Bhikkhū ‘vassaṃ vutthānaṃ
  bhagavatā vassāvāsikaṃ anuññātan 'ti kukkuccāyantā nāgamaṃsu. Atha kho
  so mahāmatto ujjhāyati khīyati vipāceti: “Kathaṃ hi nāma bhadantā mayā
  dūte pahite nāgacchissanti? Ahaṃ hi senāya gacchāmi, dujjānaṃ jīvitaṃ,
  dujjānaṃ maraṇan ”ti. Assosuṃ kho bhikkhū tassa mahāmattassa
  ujjhāyantassa khīyantassa vipācentassa. Atha kho te bhikkhū bhagavato
